      "id": "fluff-a",
      "concept": "COTTON-CANDY AND LOLLIPOP TREES",
      "width": 48,
      "height": 48,
      "seed": 115201,
      "subject": "Subject: one small candy tree, chunky and cute, each image a different one of these: a cotton-candy tree with a big fluffy round crown of pink spun sugar #f08cb8 (shadow #c25a8c, light #ffc2dc on the left side) on a short striped stick, a cotton-candy tree with a fluffy mint crown #8fdcc0 (shadow #4fa58a), a giant round swirl lollipop of red and white #e03a3e #fff4ec on a thick white stick, a tree of three stacked fluffy pink cotton-candy puffs. A short candy stick trunk. A full crown about two thirds of the image wide and nearly the full image tall.",
      "negative": "face, eyes, person, ground, sand patch, grass, pot, hand, wrapper"
    },
    {
      "id": "cane-a",
