      "width": 48,
      "height": 48,
      "seed": 115202,
      "subject": "Subject: one small candy plant, chunky and cute, each image a different one of these: a thick red and white striped candy cane #e03a3e #fff4ec standing upright with its hook at the top, a bush of big round gumdrops in pink, mint and lemon #f08cb8 #8fdcc0 #f4d46c, a tree with a round crown of pink frosting dotted with sprinkles on a gingerbread trunk #b86b34, a peppermint swirl lollipop with a mint stripe on a thick stick. Chunky and solid, about half of the image wide and nearly the full image tall.",
      "negative": "face, eyes, person, ground, sand patch, grass, pot, hand, wrapper, thin pole"
    }
